# SQL Analysis

This folder contains SQL queries used to validate dashboard KPIs and
explore customer engagement patterns from the session-level clickstream data.

## Business Questions

1. What are the core session-level KPIs?
2. Which product categories are associated with higher engagement?
3. Which product positions are associated with higher engagement?
4. Does photo type differ in observed engagement?
5. Does price category differ in observed engagement?
6. Which category-position combinations represent high-engagement segments?

SQL is used for descriptive aggregation and segmentation.
Statistical inference and effect-size analysis are performed in Python.